This product includes software developed by the ProvableWorldModel Authors.

The project has no vendored third-party source. All dependencies are ordinary
Cargo crates pinned in Cargo.lock; the only cryptographic dependency in the
verifier trust root is `blake2` (no_std). Each dependency retains its own license
and copyright; the resolved set is gated by `cargo deny check` against the
allow-list in deny.toml. The pre-pivot design vendored a proving substrate under
third_party/, which was removed when the project moved to the CommitLLM
commit-and-audit backend (see specs.md and roadmap.md).
